Subject: [PATCH 5.2 044/215] drm/crc-debugfs: Also sprinkle irqrestore over early exits
Date:   Mon, 29 Jul 2019 21:20:40 +0200
Message-Id: <20190729190748.142517155@linuxfoundation.org>
